{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541160/extras/40f10070c78ee931d540bd0c80d090d7.poster.avif?t=1750327376\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541160/extras/40f10070c78ee931d540bd0c80d090d7.webm?t=1750327376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541160/extras/40f10070c78ee931d540bd0c80d090d7.mp4?t=1750327376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>This is a story that questions the value of life...</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A collaboration between writer Tomo Kataoka, the creator of CNGAL's Best Galgame of 2020 Christmas Tina, and Kohaku Sumeragi, a popular illustrator praised in Japan and around the world, they bring you the ultimate visual novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual novels aim to immerse players in captivating narratives and evoke empathy for the characters. The mechanics are simple, often requiring just a press of a button to progress, giving even first-time players an accessible and enjoyable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In vibrant Kabukicho there is the expanding slum of Shinjuku Kowloon, which its peope call the district. The city is home to the poor, the outcast, and those exiled from society. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All-devouring Shinjuku Kowoon grows on the lives and desires of its people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dead of the district are buried by Torao Hiira. What could be the reasons behind his strange behaviour?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to Shinjuku Kowloon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2541160/2967123a3efd